{"product":{"id":8879535685868,"title":"Cortech Cobra Can Food Grade Trash Receptacle - General Use","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe Cortech Cobra Food Grade\/General Use Trash Can is virtually UNBREAKABLE and is the toughest trash receptacle available, making it ideal for continuous use in extreme environments. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e360° molded-in continuous handles surround the entire can perimeter and underside for easier lifting\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRotationally molded structural polyethylene for maximum strength while maintaining flexibility\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVirtually unbreakable and won't dent, rust or chip\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMolded-in floor glides reduce floor scratching when dragged across the floor\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.22\" Nominal wall thickness\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEasy to clean and maintain with damp cloth\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistant to stains\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColors: Green, Blue, Red, White, Yellow, Black\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\"\u003eAbout Cortech USA by Correctional Technologies:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003eCortech USA (Correctional Technologies) manufactures products that are exceptionally durable, designed for use in compassionate and normative behavioral healthcare, corrections, law enforcement, heavy use commercial and industrial environments, parks and recreation, schools, universities, hospitals, emergency and homeless shelters, and other institutions and facilities where safety and durability matter. Cortech products are ideal for extreme use and intensive use environments.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Cortech","product_type":"","created_at":"2025-04-16T13:38:49-04:00","handle":"cortech-cobra-can-food-grade-general-use-trash-receptacle","updated_at":"2026-11-13T17:30:23-05:00","publish